# §17.1380 — hypothesis' unicode cache is written by the test lanes, sometimes
# by a container running as another uid, and an unreadable file in the build
# context fails the whole build (`error checking context: no permission to read
# from '.hypothesis/unicode_data/...'`) before a single layer is evaluated.
.hypothesis
